#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:17
msgid "[0.8.0] - 2026-08-15"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:19
msgid ""
"This release makes multi-master composition work: a `typst_documents` "
"configuration declaring more than one master now produces a complete PDF "
"for each of them, with every document it reaches rendering at that "
"master's own traversal position and heading level instead of being "
"silently dropped from all but one. Achieving this required restructuring "
"what typsphinx writes to disk, so **this minor release can break a "
"working configuration** — read the `### Changed` section below, and see "
"the \"Migrating from 0.7.x to 0.8.0\" guide in the published "
"documentation for the exact rewrite each of the three breaking changes "
"needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:27 ../../../CHANGELOG.md:102 ../../../CHANGELOG.md:179
#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:260 ../../../CHANGELOG.md:314
#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:450 ../../../CHANGELOG.md:507
#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:557 ../../../CHANGELOG.md:574
