#: ../../../CHANGELOG.md:466
msgid ""
"**Wide-table glyph collision + right-margin clip (FID-01a)** — multi-"
"column tables whose cell content exceeded the text block previously "
"collided glyphs between columns and clipped the rightmost column off the "
"page margin. Fixed by emitting fr-weighted `columns: (Nfr, …)` derived "
"from docutils colwidth in `depart_table` and injecting U+200B break "
"points after `.`/`_` in in-table content, proven by a real-compile "
"`wide_table_render_gate` regression fixture"
msgstr ""

