#: ../../source/changelog.rst:321
msgid "Release Process"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:323
msgid ""
"The released version lives in ``pyproject.toml``'s ``[project].version``."
" A release runs through ``.github/workflows/release.yml``, triggered by "
"pushing a matching ``vX.Y.Z`` tag:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:326
msgid ""
"Update ``pyproject.toml``'s version and add a curated ``## [X.Y.Z]`` "
"section to ``CHANGELOG.md``, then push the ``vX.Y.Z`` tag (or trigger the"
" workflow manually with the tag as input)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:329
msgid ""
"The ``validate`` job checks the tag against ``pyproject.toml``'s version "
"and aborts on a mismatch, aborts if ``CHANGELOG.md`` has no matching non-"
"empty ``## [X.Y.Z]`` section, then runs the test suite and linters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:332
msgid "The ``build`` job produces the wheel and sdist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:333
msgid ""
"The ``publish-pypi`` job runs behind the protected ``pypi`` GitHub "
"environment and requires a manual approval before it uploads the package "
"to PyPI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/changelog.rst:335
msgid ""
"The ``create-release`` job extracts that same ``## [X.Y.Z]`` CHANGELOG "
"section and publishes it as the body of a GitHub Release, with the built "
"wheel and sdist attached."
msgstr ""

